ng-term change","p_rain":"Rhinelander's yearly precipitation shows no clear long-term change (+0.11 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 30.7 inches a year. The wettest year was 2019 (43.15 in); the driest, 2003 (15.32 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":false,"hi":false},"t_year":"2026 so far: 2 daily record highs, 2 daily record lows"}}